Thu Oct 15 21:39:56 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Complete the runtime closure: list all 20 remaining DT_NEEDED system
  sonames (glib/gio/atk/dbus/cups/gtk-deps/X11 set) as Requires. The
  __requires_exclude_from for /opt/helium suppresses all auto-Requires,
  so the previous 6-soname list relied on coincidental providers (e.g.
  the gtk3-tools posttrans chain); every soname the helium binary links
  is now explicit, mirroring debian.control and the fedora-nexus twin's
  auto-generated set.

